  "steps": [
    "Mix all the ingredients mentioned above and coat 150g low fat paneer (homemade) in this mixture. Let it sit in the fridge for atleast 15 mins before you grill it.",
    "In a pan, brush a little oil and grill this paneer on both sides until brown.",
    "In a pan, sauté garlic and chilli flakes. Add onion and rest of the veggies. Sauté for 5 mins on high flame and then add salt, pepper, mixed herbs, soy sauce. Mix this. Turn off the flame and add grated cheese.",
    "Mix this all well and add a dash of water to achieve the desired consistency."
  ],
